---
layout: "layouts/base.hbs"
permalink: "/strategic-patterns.html"
tags: ["publicPage"]
title: "Strategic Patterns"
style: "patterns"
description: "Run a small, complete application with Docker, follow one job through the code, and adapt what fits your stack."
breadcrumbParent: "/patterns.html"
---
<nav class="pattern-index-jumps" aria-label="Find a strategic pattern">
  <a href="#applications-title">By problem</a>
  <a href="#technologies-title">By technology</a>
  <a href="#demonstrations-title">By feature</a>
</nav>
<section class="strategic-pattern-index" aria-labelledby="applications-title">
  <h2 id="applications-title">Find a pattern for your application.</h2>
  {{#each collections.patternGroups}}
    {{#if (eq id "strategic")}}
      <ul class="pattern-cards strategic-pattern-cards">
        {{#each entries}}
          <li class="pattern-card">
            <h3><a class="pattern-card-link" href="{{this.url}}">{{data.title}}</a></h3>
            <p>{{data.description}}</p>
            {{#if data.stack}}{{> components/pattern-stack stack=data.stack}}{{/if}}
            {{#if data.demoSlug}}
              <a class="button button-primary pattern-card-start" href="{{this.url}}#start-here"
                 aria-label="Run it and follow the code: {{data.title}}">Run it and follow the code →</a>
            {{/if}}
          </li>
        {{/each}}
      </ul>
    {{/if}}
  {{/each}}
</section>
<section class="pattern-technology-index" aria-labelledby="technologies-title">
  <h2 id="technologies-title">Already have a stack in mind?</h2>
  <p>Find the same problem-led patterns by their supporting technology. Every Strategic Pattern starts with Docker commands, a short route through the code and something useful to try next. These links are another way in, not a second set of tutorials.</p>
  <dl>
    {{#each collections.patternTechnologies}}
      <div>
        <dt><span class="pattern-technology">{{> components/pattern-technology}}</span></dt>
        <dd>{{#each patterns}}<a href="{{this.url}}">{{data.title}}</a>{{#unless @last}} · {{/unless}}{{/each}}</dd>
      </div>
    {{/each}}
  </dl>
</section>
<section class="pattern-technology-index" aria-labelledby="demonstrations-title">
  <h2 id="demonstrations-title">See a feature working in context.</h2>
  <p>These examples exercise a useful behavior, not merely mention its API. The same links appear beside the relevant reference sections.</p>
  <dl>
    {{#each collections.patternTopics}}
      <div>
        <dt><a href="{{reference}}">{{title}}</a></dt>
        <dd>{{#each (patternExamples id)}}<a href="{{href}}">{{label}}</a>{{#unless @last}} · {{/unless}}{{/each}}</dd>
      </div>
    {{/each}}
  </dl>
</section>
{{> components/technology-credits}}
